  "sketchNote": "A layout, not a design. The yellow blocks are the two pages the game writes on (24 wide by 33 tall each, from (5,6) and (35,6)): keep each one plain light paper, fully opaque, at most 3 colours, so dark words read on it. Everything around them is yours: the cover (o), the paper's edges and the gutter (+ and -), the stack of pages under them. Want a fatter cover or a curl at the page corners? Move or shrink the pages in this slot file, keep each at least 24 by 31, and the app follows.",
  "use": "the Shelf tab: the ledger you point at or pick, out of the shelf and open beside it, with its name and numbers written on the pages"
